WEBVTT

01:09.819 --> 01:10.945
Ms. Choi

01:11.613 --> 01:14.574
was the only adult
that was ever kind to me.

01:15.909 --> 01:17.619
Everyone else had already given up on me,

01:17.702 --> 01:21.331
but Ms. Choi was the only person
who believed I could be something more.

01:23.333 --> 01:24.709
I realize now

01:26.377 --> 01:29.464
the truth is that, all this time,
I was in love with Ms. Choi.

01:50.860 --> 01:52.445
-You made it.
-Hm.

01:55.281 --> 01:57.242
Why is it so dark in here?

01:57.325 --> 01:58.159
Take this.

01:58.660 --> 01:59.536
Thank you.

01:59.619 --> 02:02.038
People who live alone
shouldn't live in the dark.

02:02.705 --> 02:04.958
I just cooked up some fresh kimchi.

02:05.041 --> 02:07.544
I ended up making too much,
and I know you love it.

02:08.795 --> 02:10.755
Were you planning on feeding an army?

02:20.431 --> 02:22.142
Jeez, I can't open it.

02:22.225 --> 02:23.059
What?

02:25.228 --> 02:27.772
-The knot's too tight.
-I didn't want it to leak.

02:28.731 --> 02:30.233
Mission accomplished.

02:40.118 --> 02:41.452
Would you like a drink?

02:49.210 --> 02:50.378
Mr. Choi.

03:00.805 --> 03:03.183
Once we become motivated by revenge…

03:06.853 --> 03:08.521
it'll mean we've gone too far.

03:09.439 --> 03:10.273
Hm.

03:10.356 --> 03:14.152
Hwa-jin, I don't want to be forced
to tell you to forget about my daughter.

03:15.445 --> 03:16.446
Yes, sir.

03:17.572 --> 03:19.490
Come and sit down with me.

03:19.991 --> 03:22.493
Let's have some of that kimchi I brought.

03:25.371 --> 03:26.789
Is instant rice okay with you?

03:26.873 --> 03:30.585
Are you really about to feed
your father-in-law some pre-cooked junk?

03:30.668 --> 03:33.171
Well, you were the one
who made some last time I was over.

03:34.130 --> 03:36.007
Don't talk back,
and make some crispy rice.

03:40.178 --> 03:42.639
-Insolence.
-I'll buy some rice and come right back.

03:42.722 --> 03:44.015
You don't have rice?

03:44.098 --> 03:47.352
If you want crispy rice,
I can make it from the instant rice.

03:48.770 --> 03:51.105
No, I don't want… I just want some…

03:51.189 --> 03:52.815
Instant packs are just as good.

03:52.899 --> 03:55.109
-I want freshly-cooked rice.
-Sure.

03:55.193 --> 03:56.611
I eat instant every day.

03:56.694 --> 03:59.280
Approval ratings
for the ERPB have surpassed 50%

03:59.364 --> 04:00.406
for the first time.

04:00.490 --> 04:02.742
In a survey
on potential presidential candidates,

04:02.825 --> 04:05.161
Minister Choi Gang-seok's approval rating
has risen sharply

04:05.245 --> 04:07.789
compared with his results
in the previous poll.

04:07.872 --> 04:11.751
Some say that his views on educational
reform are just what the country needs.

04:11.834 --> 04:12.961
That's right.

04:13.044 --> 04:15.505
Although some still argue
that the ERPB has yet to prove

04:15.588 --> 04:19.300
that they are not motivated by personal
vendettas, given that the core members

04:19.384 --> 04:22.929
are both related to the teacher
who was murdered two years ago--

04:28.059 --> 04:30.436
This looks so good. Ooh!

04:34.274 --> 04:36.567
Don't you have hot water at your place?

04:36.651 --> 04:40.571
No, this is just easier.
By the time I get home, it'll be perfect.

04:40.655 --> 04:42.365
That's why I said I'd buy you dinner.

04:42.448 --> 04:44.951
Well, sharing dinner with my boss
feels like work.

04:45.576 --> 04:46.703
Hm.

04:47.203 --> 04:48.288
Did I say that out loud?

04:48.371 --> 04:51.416
Thank you for the kind comments.
I'll be sure to keep them in mind.

04:52.834 --> 04:56.462
Sorry, sir, but is it okay
if I just… call it for tonight?

04:56.546 --> 04:59.215
Why? I can drop you off.
Are you in a hurry?

04:59.299 --> 05:02.844
It's just, every time we stay together,
there's always something that happens

05:02.927 --> 05:05.596
which extends our work hours
on, and on, and on--

05:05.680 --> 05:06.639
Just a minute.

05:06.723 --> 05:08.141
What are they doing?

05:10.601 --> 05:12.478
Looks like they're breaking into a car.

05:14.397 --> 05:17.817
-Let's just contact the police.
-No, they're still in school uniforms.

05:17.900 --> 05:18.818
Get a move on.

05:20.028 --> 05:22.363
Deputy Bong, protect this with your life.

05:24.240 --> 05:26.784
Uh, sir, what do you want me to do?

05:27.368 --> 05:29.579
Stay there.

05:30.163 --> 05:33.041
I was actually planning on going home
to clean my graphics card.

05:33.124 --> 05:34.083
So, could I maybe--

05:37.462 --> 05:40.965
Oh. You shouldn't have taken so much.
God, would you just stand up?

05:48.973 --> 05:50.600
Yes! It's fucking open!

05:50.683 --> 05:52.185
-Come on, please work.
-Let's go!

05:52.268 --> 05:54.395
Yes! Let's go, let's go, let's go!

05:54.479 --> 05:55.980
Holy shit, we're-- Oh, shit!

05:56.064 --> 05:57.774
-Stop.
-What the fuck?

05:58.399 --> 06:00.693
-Guys, get out.
-Just move! Out of the way!

06:02.028 --> 06:03.029
Get out of the way! Just--

06:03.112 --> 06:06.115
What are you doing?
What is this, a water fight? Water guns?

06:06.199 --> 06:08.659
-That's enough. Now get out.
-Stop that.

06:08.743 --> 06:11.245
-Oh shit! Dude, it's just going.
-Stop the car.

06:11.329 --> 06:13.831
Hey, watch out!
I'm just going forward. Look out!

06:13.915 --> 06:15.875
-He's blocking my view now.
-Hey!

06:15.958 --> 06:18.336
-Move out of the way!
-Stop the car now!

06:18.419 --> 06:20.380
Look at this guy.
How is he holding on like that?

06:20.463 --> 06:22.757
Would you just walk straight already?

06:22.840 --> 06:23.966
Hey.

06:25.134 --> 06:27.887
-Yeah?
-I work for the ERPB.

06:27.970 --> 06:29.639
Tell me what you're doing with that girl.

06:31.224 --> 06:33.309
You're with the ERPB?

06:41.818 --> 06:43.111
Get out of the way! Get off!

06:46.322 --> 06:47.657
Inspector, are you okay?

06:47.740 --> 06:49.867
Those damn brats need to learn.

06:50.660 --> 06:51.911
-Hey, get out of the way!
-Oh!

06:55.498 --> 06:56.833
Dude, that was insane!

07:00.169 --> 07:02.046
Woo-hoo!

07:02.130 --> 07:04.257
Let's go! Whoo!

07:04.340 --> 07:06.092
These fucking kids.

07:10.388 --> 07:11.848
Catch up by foot!

07:13.558 --> 07:14.725
What the hell?

07:16.686 --> 07:18.312
Whoa, this is so messed up!

07:22.066 --> 07:24.110
-Hold on back there!
-Whoa!

07:27.447 --> 07:29.782
Whoa! Whoa, whoa, whoa. Whoa, whoa, whoa!

07:29.866 --> 07:32.535
It's hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

07:33.453 --> 07:36.831
You see how good I am? I should be
a professional race car driver!

07:38.583 --> 07:41.002
-Hold tight! I'm gonna swerve this bitch!
-Oh fuck!

07:41.085 --> 07:42.253
Whoo!

07:43.629 --> 07:45.548
Please go slower, Inspector!

07:47.800 --> 07:49.760
Holy shit. This guy isn't dead?

07:49.844 --> 07:51.012
-No way.
-How?

07:51.095 --> 07:52.263
Fucking light 'em up!

07:52.972 --> 07:55.349
Hey! You kids stop the car!

07:55.433 --> 07:58.644
Let's go! Shoot these fuckers!

07:58.728 --> 08:01.147
Show 'em what we're working with.

08:01.230 --> 08:03.691
-Fuck, it's burning my fingers!
-This is wild.

08:03.774 --> 08:06.486
Oh! Oh!

08:08.279 --> 08:09.655
Boom!

08:12.074 --> 08:14.702
Whoa! Whoa!

08:16.329 --> 08:17.747
I can't believe this.

08:23.169 --> 08:25.463
Oh! Oh!

08:27.173 --> 08:30.259
-Whoa.
-I got a gift for you! And all of you!

08:31.302 --> 08:35.223
-Whoo! Fireball!
-Those kids, they just don't get it.

08:38.935 --> 08:40.478
Fireball!

08:40.561 --> 08:41.646
Whoo!

08:41.729 --> 08:44.106
-Ha! Whoa!
-Ah! Ah. Oh!

08:45.066 --> 08:47.026
Fireball!

08:49.111 --> 08:51.906
Woo-hoo! Whoa!

08:51.989 --> 08:54.825
Bang, bang!

08:58.037 --> 09:01.123
Holy shit! That's, like,
the craziest thing we've done!

09:01.207 --> 09:03.292
What the fuck?
Is the guy still behind us? Fuck!

09:03.376 --> 09:06.462
Oh! Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Hey, hey, hey ! Hey, whoa!

09:06.546 --> 09:07.797
No, no, no, no, no.

09:09.173 --> 09:10.424
Come on, don't stop!

09:12.176 --> 09:14.262
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Oh, whoa! Whoa!

09:18.474 --> 09:21.602
Min-su, that was crazy.
How do you drive so good?

09:23.145 --> 09:24.855
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa! Whoa, whoa!

09:24.939 --> 09:26.649
Why are you still holding that?

09:27.149 --> 09:28.609
Because if I don't, she'll kill me.

09:35.074 --> 09:38.077
-Whoa!
-Watch out! You're spilling that.

09:40.121 --> 09:41.622
-Hey!
-Whoa!

09:41.706 --> 09:42.665
-Hey!
-Careful!

09:42.748 --> 09:45.376
Pull over, now!

09:45.459 --> 09:47.962
-You fuckers.
-Just get lost, fucking weirdo!

09:48.045 --> 09:51.007
-You're never gonna stop us, you dumbass.
-Kids are flipping me off.

09:52.216 --> 09:53.718
-Whoa, please slow down!
-Come on.

09:53.801 --> 09:55.845
You ain't gonna do nothing.

09:58.723 --> 10:00.266
-Oh!
-Move out of the way!

10:01.976 --> 10:03.436
I'm gonna hit them!

10:05.062 --> 10:07.106
Goddamn it!

10:07.189 --> 10:08.566
Oh shit.

10:09.483 --> 10:11.360
What are you doing?

10:13.487 --> 10:15.740
I think I broke my leg.

10:15.823 --> 10:18.200
Whoa!

10:18.284 --> 10:19.994
Turn the car off now!

10:25.916 --> 10:26.917
Who are you?

10:32.089 --> 10:33.257
Juvenile offenders.

10:34.050 --> 10:36.594
-What?
-We're 14, actually.

10:38.804 --> 10:39.805
Huh.

10:42.600 --> 10:45.353
Everybody step back.
Give the police some space.

10:45.853 --> 10:48.397
INCHEON GANGHWA POLICE STATION

10:48.481 --> 10:51.359
We were simply
stopping for some food, and by chance…

10:51.442 --> 10:54.654
Careful, miss.
Please stay awake. Are you all right?

10:54.737 --> 10:57.698
One thing led to another, and my colleague

10:57.782 --> 11:00.076
managed to throw a bike,
and it got stuck under their car.

11:00.159 --> 11:01.243
Are you all right?

11:05.915 --> 11:07.083
We need you to stay awake.

11:08.250 --> 11:12.129
Leave her. Yun-jin's just drunk.
She drank three bottles or something.

11:12.213 --> 11:15.049
-No, she drank way more.
-Yeah, she drank a lot.

11:15.132 --> 11:18.386
Seriously, though, you guys
are acting like we wanted to hurt her,

11:18.469 --> 11:20.012
but we didn't do anything like that.

11:20.096 --> 11:21.472
We're all friends.

11:21.555 --> 11:22.932
-Exactly.
-Right.

11:24.183 --> 11:25.601
Are they really your friends?

11:26.268 --> 11:28.145
Yes, they're my friends.

11:29.146 --> 11:31.190
So just leave us alone, okay?

11:31.273 --> 11:34.944
See, I wasn't lying. She just told
you we're friends. We're like besties.

11:35.027 --> 11:36.195
-Yeah.
-Enough!

11:36.278 --> 11:37.571
You guys are guilty of car theft,

11:37.655 --> 11:39.699
driving without a license,
and violating traffic laws.

11:39.782 --> 11:42.034
-We're very sorry, sir!
-So sorry, sir.

11:42.118 --> 11:45.621
But we only drove it out of curiosity
since it was already running.

11:45.705 --> 11:47.832
That's right.
So it's really not our fault.

11:47.915 --> 11:49.792
We just did it
because of our raging hormones.

11:49.875 --> 11:52.294
-Because of puberty.
-It was out of our control.

11:52.378 --> 11:55.423
Seriously, we are deeply remorseful
for what we did.

11:55.506 --> 11:56.549
Please forgive us.

11:56.632 --> 11:58.884
Please forgive us. Please forgive us.

11:58.968 --> 12:02.847
-Do you think we're gonna fall for this?
-Im Han-rim. That's enough.

12:04.432 --> 12:06.642
They know that they won't be punished
for saying this.

12:06.726 --> 12:10.020
He's right. These kids
have been here many times already.

12:10.104 --> 12:13.733
And since they're juvenile offenders,
they know we can't press charges.

12:13.816 --> 12:17.069
They always claim they didn't know what
they were doing, so we can't charge them.

12:17.153 --> 12:18.195
Isn't that right?

12:18.779 --> 12:20.906
-You spoke to the parents?
-Yes.

12:20.990 --> 12:22.450
Gonna be a while before they're here.

12:22.533 --> 12:24.618
Well, actually our homeroom teacher
will be here soon.

12:25.327 --> 12:27.455
-Hand them over once he's here.
-Yes, sir.

12:27.538 --> 12:29.457
-Chief?
-Yeah?

12:30.499 --> 12:32.042
So, what are you gonna do about them?

12:32.126 --> 12:35.129
We've already tried to send
some of their cases to juvenile court,

12:35.212 --> 12:38.466
but for now all we can do is wait
and let them off with a warning.

12:39.884 --> 12:42.553
I heard the school was having
the same problem with them.

12:44.889 --> 12:45.848
Speak of the devil.

12:46.474 --> 12:48.976
-You can ask him yourself.
-Good Evening, Mr. Lee.

12:51.479 --> 12:53.564
CUSTODY HANDOVER CONFIRMATION FORM

12:56.859 --> 12:58.027
He's full of shit.

13:05.034 --> 13:06.535
We'll be on our way now.

13:06.619 --> 13:09.789
I want all of you in my office tomorrow
so we can talk about what happened.

13:09.872 --> 13:11.665
-Thank you.
-Thank you for taking care of us.

13:11.749 --> 13:13.501
-Thank you very much!
-Thank you.

13:15.836 --> 13:17.838
-We'll take our leave now.
-Get her home safely.

13:17.922 --> 13:19.673
Thank you for your hard work.

13:23.177 --> 13:24.887
It's an uncomfortable sight, huh?

13:24.970 --> 13:27.056
It happens so much.
It's hard to get used to.

13:27.139 --> 13:29.016
I hear you're from the ERPB?

13:29.099 --> 13:31.727
Yes, we are. I'm Inspector Na Hwa-jin.

13:33.395 --> 13:37.525
I'm sorry to bother you,
but it appears that you two

13:37.608 --> 13:39.610
will need to write
an additional statement.

13:39.693 --> 13:40.861
Those kids reported you.

13:41.904 --> 13:43.781
-What for?
-For child abuse.

13:43.864 --> 13:46.867
These days, kids can report you
through an app if they want.

13:46.951 --> 13:49.119
You're kidding me?

13:50.538 --> 13:53.833
I'm sorry about what happened.
I should have taught them better.

13:53.916 --> 13:56.252
Don't worry. I'm sure you tried your best.

13:56.335 --> 13:58.462
I'm embarrassed to admit this
as a teacher,

13:59.129 --> 14:01.882
but the school has no idea
what to do with these kids.

14:01.966 --> 14:05.553
They can get away with whatever they want.
They know that adults can't do anything.

14:07.721 --> 14:09.640
Isn't there anything you can do
as their teacher?

14:09.723 --> 14:12.309
They know, as minors,
they can't be liable for their crimes,

14:12.393 --> 14:13.602
and schools can't change that.

14:13.686 --> 14:17.523
And the fact that middle school
is mandatory, it'd be hard to expel them.

14:21.151 --> 14:21.986
Sir!

14:24.864 --> 14:28.325
-So you were outsmarted by some kids?
-Yes, sir.

14:28.409 --> 14:32.288
I've heard about how much juvenile
offenders are allowed to get away with.

14:32.371 --> 14:35.791
Maybe I put too much faith
in ex-Special Forces agents.

14:37.918 --> 14:39.587
Whoa, my turn! My turn!

14:39.670 --> 14:42.590
Who are those kids?

14:43.716 --> 14:46.343
The ones we were talking about.
The same ones that bested us.

14:46.427 --> 14:48.095
Try to catch us now!

14:49.972 --> 14:51.724
Hello, guys.

14:54.226 --> 14:56.186
Good luck with your car!

14:56.270 --> 14:57.521
They seem fun.

14:57.605 --> 15:00.983
-Their school was Hyeonjin Middle School?
-Yeah.

15:01.066 --> 15:02.735
We start work there tomorrow.

15:14.830 --> 15:16.123
Jung Seung-jin.

15:16.916 --> 15:18.834
Yo, you don't wanna say hi to me?

15:18.918 --> 15:20.544
Oh, uh, sorry.

15:21.045 --> 15:21.962
You lookin' at me?

15:22.504 --> 15:23.464
Did I hit you?

15:23.547 --> 15:25.716
-No, no, you didn't.
-Of course I did, you stupid idiot.

15:25.799 --> 15:27.343
Would you look at that?

15:27.843 --> 15:28.844
Ah, good morning.

15:28.928 --> 15:29.762
-Hello.
-Morning.

15:30.638 --> 15:33.223
-And who's your new friend?
-I'm Jung Seung-jin.

15:33.307 --> 15:35.935
Jung Seung-jin, off you go.

15:36.018 --> 15:37.144
-Get to class.
-Okay.

15:37.227 --> 15:39.438
Make sure to put my stuff on my desk.

15:39.521 --> 15:42.566
Hey, you should try to skip school
once in a while.

15:42.650 --> 15:46.153
You know, give the other students
an opportunity to breathe.

15:46.236 --> 15:48.113
You guys actually came, then.

15:48.197 --> 15:49.114
I'm surprised.

15:49.198 --> 15:51.200
Well, given how kind you were yesterday,

15:51.283 --> 15:53.786
we came here
to return the favor to you guys.

15:53.869 --> 15:54.870
What's that?

15:54.954 --> 15:58.832
Starting today, we will be
investigating this school. You guys ready?

15:58.916 --> 16:01.085
-We can't right now.
-How come? Too busy?

16:01.168 --> 16:03.087
Actually, we're free. Right, guys?

16:03.587 --> 16:05.756
Okay. Come with me.

16:05.839 --> 16:08.425
-"Come with me!"
-We get to skip class.

16:10.844 --> 16:12.429
We're gonna be famous.

16:12.513 --> 16:14.598
I'm gonna get so many followers.

16:14.682 --> 16:16.767
I don't have
a signature yet for autographs.

16:17.643 --> 16:19.853
I told you
we were investigating this school.

16:19.937 --> 16:22.189
I got it. You're trying
to buy some time, aren't you?

16:22.272 --> 16:25.025
-It's like in the movies.
-He lied about the investigation.

16:25.109 --> 16:28.779
They're just keeping us away from everyone
while they get statements from students.

16:28.862 --> 16:31.240
Look at you.
Aren't you a smart little guy?

16:31.323 --> 16:33.117
Since you already know, why not confess?

16:33.200 --> 16:35.452
Just do what you need to do, Inspector.

16:41.166 --> 16:42.209
Say thank you, okay?

16:42.960 --> 16:45.587
Anything you say
will be kept confidential.

16:45.671 --> 16:48.924
Tell me about Min Ji-ung's gang.
Have you ever been attacked by these guys?

16:49.008 --> 16:50.551
Or seen them attack other kids?

16:52.302 --> 16:53.679
I've never seen anything.

16:54.388 --> 16:55.514
I haven't, no.

16:55.597 --> 16:58.392
We're not really friends,
so I can't help you.

16:58.475 --> 17:01.937
-Please just leave me alone.
-I'm sorry, but I don't know.

17:02.021 --> 17:03.397
No, never.

17:12.990 --> 17:13.907
Han-rim,

17:14.992 --> 17:17.453
I asked around about Yun-jin
like you asked me to.

17:17.536 --> 17:21.081
And while she does seem
to hang out with Min Ji-ung, well,

17:21.707 --> 17:23.208
they're not exactly friends.

17:23.292 --> 17:25.753
-And if they're not friends--
-What are they, then?

17:25.836 --> 17:28.255
Honestly, I didn't really
learn anything more.

17:30.132 --> 17:31.717
Do you know where I can find her?

17:32.217 --> 17:35.220
That's the thing. She should be here,
but she's not in class.

17:37.806 --> 17:40.726
-Do you know where this is?
-Near the recycling bins.

17:41.310 --> 17:43.687
I don't think she's there.
Look at the other cameras.

17:44.480 --> 17:45.647
Usually these kinds of gangs

17:45.731 --> 17:49.526
look for hideouts in places
that are isolated from everything else.

17:49.610 --> 17:53.322
They hang out in places where the cleaners
and maintenance people work.

17:53.405 --> 17:54.948
Easier to hide from the teachers there.

17:56.825 --> 18:00.204
Well, if we take that
into consideration then,

18:01.288 --> 18:02.414
here maybe?

18:02.915 --> 18:04.416
What is this place?

18:04.500 --> 18:06.418
It's a utilities building,
not far from the gym.

18:07.336 --> 18:08.337
Oh!

18:16.428 --> 18:17.846
I think this might be it.

18:18.847 --> 18:19.932
Look over here.

18:20.766 --> 18:21.767
Oh.

18:25.062 --> 18:27.147
Here, it's this way. Oh.

18:32.653 --> 18:33.654
Oh.

18:35.072 --> 18:37.866
Oh! There should be the key around here.

18:38.909 --> 18:40.119
Are you in there?

18:42.913 --> 18:44.039
Stand back.

18:45.040 --> 18:45.958
What?

18:46.041 --> 18:48.335
Han-rim! Oh. What are you…
What are you doing?

19:22.411 --> 19:24.121
Here. I'll take that.

19:29.710 --> 19:31.753
Can I ask what you were doing in there?

19:34.840 --> 19:36.550
Was it Min Ji-ung who locked you in?

19:39.303 --> 19:40.888
Why were you with them yesterday?

19:42.014 --> 19:43.265
We were out drinking.

19:43.348 --> 19:46.143
Then how come
I didn't smell any alcohol on you?

19:48.020 --> 19:50.147
And if you hadn't been drinking
last night,

19:51.773 --> 19:53.942
why were you stumbling around like that?

19:58.947 --> 20:00.991
Can I see what's in your bag?

20:01.658 --> 20:02.701
What? No.

20:03.577 --> 20:04.953
Hey, take it easy.

20:12.502 --> 20:13.712
Can you tell me what this is?

20:15.005 --> 20:16.089
They're just vitamins.

20:16.798 --> 20:20.385
Oh, that's good to know. Then I'm sure
you wouldn't mind if I took one.

20:20.469 --> 20:23.639
I've been working late recently.
I wanna make sure I'm healthy.

20:23.722 --> 20:25.182
No, don't take that!

20:28.101 --> 20:31.813
If I shouldn't take it, then you
shouldn't be taking these vitamins either.

20:36.318 --> 20:37.986
Were you on these pills yesterday?

20:38.987 --> 20:40.864
That why you were stumbling?

20:40.948 --> 20:42.783
Yun-jin, were you high on these drugs?

20:51.375 --> 20:52.751
-Hey, Yun!
-Hey!

20:52.834 --> 20:54.461
Ah!

20:55.796 --> 20:57.589
Whoa, you look so pretty today.

20:57.673 --> 21:01.260
-Did you change your eye shadow? Or blush?
-Blush. Doesn't it look good?

21:01.343 --> 21:03.387
It looks so good.
You look like the popular girls.

21:03.470 --> 21:04.513
You really do.

21:05.055 --> 21:07.891
Just lose a bit of weight.
It's too late for me.

21:07.975 --> 21:10.602
But if you lose a bit of weight,
you could be like a celebrity!

21:10.686 --> 21:12.604
I don't know.
I think I'm having a growth spurt.

21:12.688 --> 21:14.022
I've been so hungry lately.

21:14.106 --> 21:14.940
Oh.

21:15.023 --> 21:16.942
Yeah, we kind of see it
on the Shorts you post.

21:17.025 --> 21:18.110
No, for real?

21:18.694 --> 21:19.987
You could kinda see it a bit.

21:21.863 --> 21:26.326
Then I guess this is day one of starting
my diet until I become a celebrity.

21:26.410 --> 21:29.621
-You say that every time.
-This time, I'm serious.

21:31.373 --> 21:32.958
CHEWY COOKIES
DUBAI CHOCOLATE

21:37.963 --> 21:40.674
You're not eating today?
Oh, you're broke. Is that it?

21:40.757 --> 21:42.926
No, I'm just trying to lose some weight.

21:43.010 --> 21:44.803
You'd be a lot prettier if you did.

21:44.886 --> 21:46.346
Do you really think so?

21:46.430 --> 21:49.308
You shouldn't be starving yourself
to lose weight. I have a better way.

21:51.184 --> 21:52.019
Here.

21:54.438 --> 21:57.566
Just take some of these.
Someone I know lost 40 pounds with this.

21:57.649 --> 21:59.484
I stole a few pills without them knowing.

22:00.068 --> 22:02.279
All I know is
they lost 40 pounds like nothing.

22:02.362 --> 22:04.364
And apparently,
all your favorite celebrities,

22:04.448 --> 22:05.657
they're taking them too.

22:05.741 --> 22:08.452
Just take one pill.
It'll change your whole life.

22:08.535 --> 22:11.538
There's no way it could be bad for you.
It's a cute little heart.

22:14.875 --> 22:15.792
Try it. Come on.

22:17.627 --> 22:18.837
Put it in water.

22:25.010 --> 22:26.636
You can pay me back if it works.

22:31.308 --> 22:32.809
-If you don't want it, give it--
-Wait.

22:40.734 --> 22:43.945
TYPICAL DANCE SKILLS
OF A MIDDLE SCHOOL GIRL

22:46.740 --> 22:48.075
Yun-jin.

22:49.534 --> 22:51.620
I saw your Short, and you looked so good.

22:52.204 --> 22:53.246
Did the pill work?

22:53.747 --> 22:54.790
I think it worked.

22:54.873 --> 22:56.875
Well, that's great to hear.
Do you want some more?

22:59.669 --> 23:00.629
Do you have some?

23:00.712 --> 23:02.381
Of course I do.

23:06.093 --> 23:07.761
Heart for you.

23:08.261 --> 23:10.555
Ji-ung, do you think
you could get me some of those pills?

23:10.639 --> 23:13.934
Well, sure I can. But it'll cost ya.
These things aren't free.

23:14.017 --> 23:15.352
I'll pay for it.

23:16.228 --> 23:18.105
-How much are they?
-Thirty thousand.

23:32.285 --> 23:33.620
That's 50 now.

23:34.955 --> 23:35.831
What?

23:37.290 --> 23:38.291
Hm.

23:43.255 --> 23:47.008
Let's fucking go! Fuck yeah.

23:47.092 --> 23:50.220
So, do you think
you could give me some pills?

23:51.555 --> 23:54.307
I don't have the money now,
but I'll pay you back later.

23:54.391 --> 23:55.934
It's not a fucking charity, bitch.

23:57.018 --> 23:57.853
Sorry?

23:59.187 --> 24:01.314
I was just kidding. It was a joke.

24:01.940 --> 24:03.316
Did I scare you?

24:03.900 --> 24:07.112
But you know, if you don't have any money,

24:08.572 --> 24:10.198
how about you work for it?

24:18.915 --> 24:20.000
Is your job too hard?

24:21.042 --> 24:22.294
Is it empty up there?

24:22.794 --> 24:23.670
Huh?

24:25.338 --> 24:28.967
You just give them the drugs,
take the money, and then come back here.

24:29.050 --> 24:31.094
Is that so fucking hard?

24:31.178 --> 24:35.474
Oh my God, you guys
just wanna piss me off, don't you? Huh.

24:37.142 --> 24:40.437
Yo, Yun-jin! I'm really hoping
that you won't disappoint me.

24:40.520 --> 24:41.438
Show me the money.

24:43.106 --> 24:43.940
Come on.

24:47.402 --> 24:49.404
Huh. Not bad.

24:53.533 --> 24:56.870
-I want you to raise the price by 20,000.
-Twenty thousand?

24:58.413 --> 24:59.414
That's too much.

25:00.457 --> 25:03.001
Are you a fucking dumbass by any chance?

25:03.084 --> 25:06.421
You still bought it, didn't you?
Raise it. They'll still buy them.

25:07.672 --> 25:09.174
Well, say something.

25:11.218 --> 25:12.135
Could I

25:13.428 --> 25:15.096
maybe stop doing this, please?

25:16.139 --> 25:18.350
-Ah.
-I'm just so scared. Please, I don't--

25:20.101 --> 25:21.645
Fuck. No!

25:24.564 --> 25:25.690
Give me the drugs.

25:26.316 --> 25:28.360
-What?
-The drugs, give them to me.

25:28.443 --> 25:31.738
Since you wanna quit so bad, I guess
you won't be needing these anymore.

25:36.284 --> 25:37.327
Ha!

25:37.827 --> 25:39.120
Look at that.

25:39.788 --> 25:40.997
That's 50,000 won.

25:45.794 --> 25:49.256
So, Yun-jin,
should I give you another chance?

25:53.885 --> 25:54.803
All right.

25:55.554 --> 25:56.555
What a waste.

25:57.180 --> 25:59.015
-What's this bullshit?
-It's so boring.

25:59.099 --> 26:01.226
-Take it seriously.
-You're not trying.

26:01.309 --> 26:02.561
Fucking apply yourself.

26:56.072 --> 26:58.575
SCHOOL POLICE REPORTING BOX

27:06.333 --> 27:09.419
-Yeah, take 'em!
-And never come back!

27:09.502 --> 27:12.088
-My bad, my bad.
-Stop that. Stop that. The cops.

27:12.172 --> 27:13.673
Is that really them?

27:13.757 --> 27:15.383
They're driving off with them.

27:15.884 --> 27:18.261
-Goodbye!
-Goodbye!

27:19.804 --> 27:22.724
-I hope he gets expelled at least.
-That's the minimum.

27:22.807 --> 27:26.019
-Or have him transfer schools.
-Any idea who reported them?

27:26.102 --> 27:28.855
No idea,
but I'm grateful to whoever it was.

27:32.817 --> 27:35.695
Heat transfers
from the object with a high temperature

27:35.779 --> 27:37.030
to one with a lower temperature.

27:37.113 --> 27:40.784
There are three ways that this happens.
First, let's look at conduction.

27:40.867 --> 27:43.912
When we typically sit down to eat,
we grill some meat, right?

27:43.995 --> 27:46.706
When the meat touches
the high-temperature grill,

27:46.790 --> 27:51.044
the particles of the meat that are
making contact begin moving more rapidly,

27:51.127 --> 27:53.672
and each particle is transferred in turn.

27:54.464 --> 27:55.840
Good morning, sir.

27:57.676 --> 27:59.177
Yeah, sit down.

28:01.179 --> 28:03.264
All right, let's continue with the lesson.

28:04.140 --> 28:06.017
Bitch!

28:06.601 --> 28:09.270
Thought we wouldn't find out
you reported us to the cops?

28:10.063 --> 28:14.567
Yeah, that's right.
They told us about the letter you sent.

28:14.651 --> 28:16.486
Now we have problems because of you.

28:16.569 --> 28:19.698
Lucky for me,
I'm a minor, so they let me go.

28:20.323 --> 28:22.784
Did you think
we'd end up in jail or something?

28:22.867 --> 28:24.619
Keep dreaming.

28:24.703 --> 28:26.621
We're minors.

28:26.705 --> 28:30.125
We're not c… c… c… criminals
in the eyes of the law.

28:31.668 --> 28:32.836
No!

28:36.214 --> 28:37.507
Get in there.

28:39.843 --> 28:41.052
See you later.

28:45.890 --> 28:48.143
Ji-ung! Ji-ung, please!

28:48.226 --> 28:50.812
Please open the door. I'm sorry, Ji-ung!

28:50.895 --> 28:52.897
Ji-ung?

28:53.398 --> 28:54.774
I know I was wrong.

28:54.858 --> 28:56.735
Please, just open the door.

28:57.861 --> 28:58.862
Ji-ung.

28:58.945 --> 29:00.238
If you know that you were wrong…

29:02.824 --> 29:04.451
…accept your punishment.

29:05.785 --> 29:07.537
You understand, don't you, Yun-jin?

29:07.620 --> 29:10.457
Hey, how about a group photo
to remember this moment?

29:14.753 --> 29:17.756
-Ah, I'm starving. Let's get some food.
-Yeah, same. I'm down for whatever.

29:18.381 --> 29:20.467
-What you wanna eat?
-Tonkatsu?

29:42.280 --> 29:44.699
Can you testify
to everything you just said?

29:50.413 --> 29:54.334
-It's the only way to punish them.
-I've done that before. There's no point.

29:54.834 --> 29:58.963
Our teacher, the school, even the police,
couldn't do anything to stop them.

29:59.047 --> 30:00.715
Every time, it just got worse for me.

30:02.091 --> 30:05.512
Every time, I thought,
"This is it. It'll finally be over."

30:06.012 --> 30:08.389
But each time, he came back to school.

30:10.350 --> 30:12.602
In the end, it's always me that suffers.

30:13.686 --> 30:16.397
The only way I'll escape is if I die.

30:34.374 --> 30:36.000
I promise you it'll be different.

30:37.544 --> 30:41.089
Your well-being is the priority
for all of us here at the Bureau.

30:43.007 --> 30:44.676
You need to believe in us.

30:46.511 --> 30:47.887
I'll take care of you.

30:58.147 --> 30:59.607
We're done, sir.

31:04.863 --> 31:06.614
WRITTEN STATEMENT
GO FUCK YOURSELF

31:06.698 --> 31:09.659
I see that you boys
took this very seriously.

31:09.742 --> 31:12.078
Of course we did, sir.

31:19.043 --> 31:21.713
It isn't just about the bullying
and the beatings.

31:21.796 --> 31:24.173
They're selling drugs to the kids.

31:24.257 --> 31:27.302
They get the other kids addicted
and then they make them sell pills.

31:27.385 --> 31:29.137
That's how they're making their money.

31:33.933 --> 31:35.184
You sell drugs, huh?

31:37.979 --> 31:39.939
Yeah. And what if we do?

31:40.023 --> 31:41.608
Is that a problem, sir?

31:43.985 --> 31:45.445
Oh, it is.

31:46.112 --> 31:48.197
I'm sorry. I… I didn't know.

31:48.823 --> 31:51.367
But, you know, because we're still kids,

31:51.451 --> 31:53.286
this is when we should mess up.

31:53.369 --> 31:55.788
We're just some kids
figuring it out as we go.

31:55.872 --> 31:57.332
It's hard to understand

31:58.124 --> 32:00.627
the difference between
what's wrong or right, you know?

32:03.254 --> 32:05.715
You should choose
your next words very carefully.

32:05.798 --> 32:07.258
I'm running out of patience, kid.

32:07.342 --> 32:09.218
Oh, is that so?

32:09.302 --> 32:13.222
Unfortunately, I can't stop now
since I really need the money.

32:14.307 --> 32:17.852
I'll just keep doing it
until I'm an adult, okay? Then I'll stop.

32:17.936 --> 32:20.271
I promise you. Really.

32:25.777 --> 32:27.445
All right, all right, relax.

32:27.528 --> 32:29.447
Well, if it bothers you that much…

32:30.865 --> 32:31.699
…lock me up.

32:31.783 --> 32:34.494
Take me away and throw me in jail.

32:36.955 --> 32:38.790
But you can't, can you?

32:40.625 --> 32:42.210
You just have to let us go.

32:42.293 --> 32:44.295
-That's right.
-You must be so mad.

32:44.379 --> 32:46.005
Fucked up, isn't it?

32:46.089 --> 32:47.256
And listen, and learn 

32:47.340 --> 32:49.801
And listen, and learn, repeat

32:49.884 --> 32:52.553
Listen, and learn
And listen, and learn…

32:52.637 --> 32:54.222
Get the fuck away from me!

32:55.431 --> 32:56.683
Daddy, help!

33:01.396 --> 33:03.481
Welcome!

33:03.564 --> 33:07.694
-Hey, you did a great job today.
-You go in the back. Go sit over there.

33:07.777 --> 33:10.947
-You think you can fuck with us?
-Better pray we don't catch you.

33:15.952 --> 33:18.454
Listen, and learn
And listen, and learn 

33:18.538 --> 33:20.581
And listen, and learn, repeat…

33:21.833 --> 33:23.584
-Thanks for joining us.
-Shit.

33:23.668 --> 33:27.046
And listen, and learn, repeat
Listen…

33:27.130 --> 33:28.923
You better keep running!

33:29.007 --> 33:30.299
And listen, and learn…

33:30.383 --> 33:31.300
Stay away!

33:46.065 --> 33:48.109
Han-rim? What are you doing here?

33:48.192 --> 33:49.402
It's been a while.

33:52.572 --> 33:53.698
Don't come near me.

33:54.407 --> 33:56.075
I'll fucking kill all of you.

34:00.997 --> 34:02.165
Whoo!

34:04.709 --> 34:09.297
Min Ji-ung, you're being charged with
the crimes of inciting school violence,

34:09.380 --> 34:12.592
the sale of narcotics,
coercing students into distributing drugs,

34:12.675 --> 34:15.136
and turning your school
into a living hell.

34:15.219 --> 34:18.598
So, from this point on…
you are in for a real treat.

34:30.610 --> 34:32.278
Dude, what the fuck? Where are we?

34:32.361 --> 34:33.404
Where are we going?

34:33.488 --> 34:34.697
How would I know?

34:34.781 --> 34:36.324
I have no idea where we are.

34:45.625 --> 34:47.210
Thank you for your hard work!

34:49.378 --> 34:50.421
Come on, move it.

34:50.505 --> 34:53.174
Hey, you better tell us
where the fuck we are.

34:53.257 --> 34:54.467
START OVER WITH A DREAM

34:59.388 --> 35:03.726
Welcome, everyone, to the only
juvenile detention center in Korea.

35:04.393 --> 35:07.105
You serious? You brought us to jail?

35:07.605 --> 35:09.273
You thought you'd be able to avoid this?

35:09.357 --> 35:11.442
It's time for you
to learn an important lesson.

35:13.402 --> 35:15.279
Hey, Inspector. Everything's set.

35:15.363 --> 35:16.823
Okay. Let's go.

35:16.906 --> 35:18.908
-Can he do this?
-Park the truck.

35:21.327 --> 35:24.372
-Oh, nice to meet you.
-I… I'm not sure about this.

35:24.455 --> 35:26.916
GIMCHEON JUVENILE PRISON
IS REQUESTED TO COOPERATE

35:26.999 --> 35:28.209
I don't know.

35:30.169 --> 35:32.630
Minister, do you think
the public will accept it?

35:33.214 --> 35:34.715
I'll take responsibility.

35:37.677 --> 35:41.055
I'm sure you know this
better than anyone, Minister.

35:41.556 --> 35:43.516
The reason we protect minors.

35:44.016 --> 35:47.019
If what you're planning on doing
ever got leaked to the public,

35:47.103 --> 35:48.688
the reaction would be terrible.

35:48.771 --> 35:51.440
This could lead
to abuse and gross negligence charges.

35:51.524 --> 35:53.901
Is that a good enough reason
to do nothing?

35:54.610 --> 35:57.071
One of us needs to be the adult.

35:57.572 --> 36:00.283
We need to show these kids
that there are consequences.

36:00.366 --> 36:02.118
I need your support on this.

36:03.286 --> 36:04.245
Minister.

36:04.328 --> 36:05.288
STUDENT RECORD
MIN JI-UNG

36:05.371 --> 36:06.873
-Name?
-Yoon Min-su?

36:06.956 --> 36:07.790
It's Min Ji-ung.

36:07.874 --> 36:09.458
Hyundai Apartments in Samseong, Gangnam.

36:09.542 --> 36:12.044
Place all accessories into the basket.

36:12.128 --> 36:14.547
-Ji-ung] When do we leave?
-Feet onto the markers.

36:14.630 --> 36:16.465
Pull down your underwear and squat down.

36:16.549 --> 36:17.758
A little further back.

36:17.842 --> 36:22.054
And now, put your underwear back on.
Take your belongings and move along. Next!

36:22.138 --> 36:24.849
Like you heard, pull down your underwear.

36:26.934 --> 36:28.436
More, more, more, more, more.

36:29.020 --> 36:30.730
A little more.

36:30.813 --> 36:33.274
Squat down
and lift your backside up a bit.

36:36.986 --> 36:38.446
Remove your underwear.

36:39.780 --> 36:40.740
Oh shit.

36:42.325 --> 36:44.535
Ugh!

36:57.048 --> 36:58.257
3083
NAME: CHOI U-SEONG

37:01.469 --> 37:05.181
HOPE-DRIVEN CORRECTION
THAT OPENS DOORS TO BRIGHTER FUTURES

37:11.270 --> 37:12.855
Inmates, stand up straight!

37:12.939 --> 37:13.856
Cool! Cool!

37:13.940 --> 37:16.150
From this point forward,
you will be treated

37:16.234 --> 37:18.611
with the same consideration
as the other prisoners here.

37:18.694 --> 37:22.490
You shall receive the same
mandatory physical and academic education,

37:22.573 --> 37:24.784
and you will be required
to perform volunteer work.

37:24.867 --> 37:26.369
Do you understand that?

37:26.452 --> 37:27.536
Any comments?

37:28.663 --> 37:31.874
Those with comments
can keep quiet. Let's go.

37:33.292 --> 37:35.002
-Follow me.
-Forward!

37:36.379 --> 37:37.964
We got fresh meat!

37:45.429 --> 37:47.390
-Hey, you motherfucker!
-Hey!

37:49.850 --> 37:51.435
DAILY REFLECTION AS A WAY OF LIFE

38:08.160 --> 38:09.829
There's no fucking way!

38:09.912 --> 38:11.914
Holy shit!

38:11.998 --> 38:14.917
Listen up. Inspector Im Han-rim
will now educate all of you

38:15.001 --> 38:16.919
on your current shared living space.

38:17.003 --> 38:19.255
You fuckers think
you can get away with this?

38:19.338 --> 38:23.009
Once we're out of here, I'm reporting you
for everything you did. All of you.

38:23.092 --> 38:25.636
So, ma'am, are you ready
to face the consequences?

38:25.720 --> 38:28.848
-Would you shut your mouth?
-Well, I might if you let us go!

38:29.932 --> 38:32.727
You only have one way of getting out.

38:34.353 --> 38:36.188
I'll let you go if you defeat me.

38:37.648 --> 38:39.900
-What?
-I guess I'll leave you guys alone.

38:41.944 --> 38:43.654
-What? Wait.
-Come on.

38:43.738 --> 38:45.489
Are you sure this is a good idea?

38:50.077 --> 38:52.330
Sir, wait up! Inspector, hold on!

38:53.122 --> 38:57.084
I mean, I know that they're just kids,
but there's still four of them in there.

38:57.168 --> 38:58.419
Aren't you worried?

38:59.128 --> 39:01.213
I am worried. Hm. It could be dangerous

39:01.297 --> 39:02.590
for the four boys.

39:03.090 --> 39:03.924
Hm.

39:06.260 --> 39:07.386
Just fucking do it, man.

39:10.222 --> 39:11.182
-Ha!
-Whoa!

39:12.558 --> 39:14.226
-Damn, bitch is fast!
-Ah, fuck!

39:16.479 --> 39:17.605
Ha!

39:18.481 --> 39:20.858
Agh, stop! Please, it hurts!

39:20.941 --> 39:23.986
When an inmate uses violence
against an officer,

39:24.070 --> 39:26.322
said officer can use violence
against the inmate.

39:26.822 --> 39:31.243
In other words, legally speaking,
I can beat the shit out of all of you.

39:43.005 --> 39:44.090
Ow, that stings!

39:46.175 --> 39:47.343
Agh, stop!

39:49.470 --> 39:51.055
Goddammit!

39:58.521 --> 40:01.482
If you think it's unfair,
you can all attack me at once.

40:02.733 --> 40:04.985
There's probably nothing I'd love more

40:05.486 --> 40:07.321
than to beat up all of you, huh?

40:08.531 --> 40:09.365
Uh…

40:11.367 --> 40:13.119
-You'll wake up at 6:30.
-What?

40:13.202 --> 40:17.581
Roll call will be conducted for
30 minutes. Breakfast will begin at 7 a.m.

40:18.082 --> 40:21.710
For the following three hours, you will be
attending to your favorite tasks.

40:21.794 --> 40:24.964
At 13:00 hours, you will exercise
and receive medical treatment,

40:25.589 --> 40:28.926
and at 14:00 hours,
you'll partake in a few special classes.

40:29.552 --> 40:32.888
After training, you will attend
information technology classes.

40:32.972 --> 40:35.015
Yawning in class is prohibited.

40:35.099 --> 40:37.309
No messing around with school supplies.

40:37.393 --> 40:38.352
Your choice.

40:38.436 --> 40:40.146
Inspector Im Han-rim!

40:41.605 --> 40:42.940
Okay, Deputy Bong.

40:43.023 --> 40:44.525
Inmates, assemble now!

40:47.069 --> 40:49.155
That's not long enough. Again!

40:55.161 --> 40:57.955
SSD. Ever heard of it?

40:58.038 --> 41:00.875
It's what's known
as a memory storage device.

41:02.751 --> 41:04.420
Inspector Im Han-rim!

41:04.503 --> 41:06.130
No, I've got it here. It's the hard disk--

41:06.213 --> 41:07.715
Outside, now!

41:10.050 --> 41:12.845
Left, left, left.

41:16.891 --> 41:19.977
You got ten seconds. And time!

41:20.561 --> 41:22.771
Three, two, one, zero.

41:22.855 --> 41:24.356
-Time's up!
-Wait, no!

41:24.440 --> 41:29.445
-Looks to me like you didn't write it all.
-Inmates, assembly outside, now!

41:31.363 --> 41:33.157
We just wanna study, okay?

41:39.455 --> 41:42.124
I want all this cleaned up
by the end of the day.

41:42.208 --> 41:43.751
Is this really the best you can do?

41:45.044 --> 41:48.547
-How are we supposed to clear all this?
-Faster. Come on! Get this done properly.

41:48.631 --> 41:50.424
What the hell are you doing?

41:51.926 --> 41:53.969
Quit wasting your breath talking!

41:54.470 --> 41:56.430
Ugh, this heat is killing me!

41:56.514 --> 41:58.557
Seriously, we're gonna die out here.

42:00.267 --> 42:01.143
I can't feel my hands.

42:03.729 --> 42:05.981
-Come on. We don't have all day.
-Let's go. Move!

42:06.065 --> 42:08.275
-Whoa!
-What the fuck you looking at?

42:09.568 --> 42:12.446
-Look at the fucking ground.
-Those guys have red tags on their shirts.

42:14.073 --> 42:15.324
What does a red tag mean?

42:15.407 --> 42:17.076
It means these guys are killers.

42:17.660 --> 42:19.578
It's unbelievable.
There's so many of them.

42:20.287 --> 42:21.539
What the fuck are we doing here?

42:23.749 --> 42:26.043
What? Are you complaining already?

42:27.044 --> 42:28.837
Maybe tell them
that you're juvenile offenders.

42:30.130 --> 42:31.173
Let's see if that works.

42:32.216 --> 42:33.300
Everybody, listen up!

42:33.968 --> 42:37.888
As of today, these juvenile offenders
will get their meals before everyone else.

42:37.972 --> 42:39.765
Are you fucking joking?

42:39.848 --> 42:41.100
-No, we don't have to.
-Go.

42:42.351 --> 42:43.352
I said go.

42:43.435 --> 42:47.022
All right, come on. Let these boys
come to the front of the line.

42:48.983 --> 42:52.444
-Hurry up!
-Come on. You wanna eat? You bitches.

42:52.945 --> 42:53.946
You stupid fuck.

42:57.366 --> 43:00.202
You boys love sausages, don't you?
Make sure to enjoy them.

43:01.203 --> 43:04.832
Young perps like you need to eat
lots a protein to grow. Isn't that right?

43:04.915 --> 43:07.835
Have all the sausages you want.
You're special guests here.

43:07.918 --> 43:10.963
-Fucks are taking everything!
-Looks like now we're all out.

43:11.046 --> 43:12.381
Fuck!

43:12.464 --> 43:15.801
I expect each and every one of you
to be kind.

43:15.884 --> 43:18.178
These guys are juvenile offenders.

43:18.262 --> 43:20.973
That means that these boys
can do whatever they want.

43:21.056 --> 43:24.643
Now the rest of you will be served
rice, kimchi and salad, so eat up.

43:24.727 --> 43:26.562
I said open your mouth!

43:26.645 --> 43:29.231
-There you go.
-Eat!

43:32.860 --> 43:34.361
-Dude, the fuck?
-This is bullshit.

43:34.903 --> 43:36.322
-Fuck this shit!
-Hey!

43:37.072 --> 43:38.991
Don't do that. You're nobody's slave.

43:39.074 --> 43:41.076
Dude, I just wanna go home.

43:41.160 --> 43:42.286
Fuck's sake.

43:48.709 --> 43:50.461
You gotta clean this stuff.

43:52.379 --> 43:55.716
The guys that work in the kitchen
told me that they're quite greasy

43:55.799 --> 43:59.637
so we'd appreciate it if you could
wash these ones with a little extra care

43:59.720 --> 44:00.846
as soon as you can.

44:00.929 --> 44:04.266
Uh, you'll need to make sure
you clean the grains of rice,

44:04.350 --> 44:05.851
'cause they get really sticky.

44:05.934 --> 44:08.187
If you scrape them off like this,
it works pretty well.

44:08.270 --> 44:09.647
I'll leave you to it.

44:12.191 --> 44:14.109
How long are we gonna stay here?

44:14.193 --> 44:15.861
Are you gonna keep crying,
you fucking shit?

44:15.944 --> 44:17.488
Does my dad even know I'm here?

44:17.571 --> 44:19.198
Why hasn't he come to get us?

44:19.281 --> 44:22.493
-He'd already be here if he knew.
-It's illegal to keep him in the dark.

44:22.576 --> 44:25.913
So putting minors like us
in jail is legal? Huh?

44:25.996 --> 44:28.499
And this asshole
wants us to do the fucking dishes.

44:28.582 --> 44:31.043
These guys are fucked
when my dad finds out!

44:31.126 --> 44:32.127
That's the thing.

44:34.546 --> 44:35.589
They don't know.

44:36.757 --> 44:38.926
-So let's make sure they know.
-How do we do that?

44:40.219 --> 44:41.553
There has to be some way.

44:42.179 --> 44:44.598
They'll keep piling up
if you don't clean them.

44:45.182 --> 44:47.059
-My eyes!
-Are you kidding me?

44:47.726 --> 44:49.978
-Sorry about that.
-The fuck do you think you are?

44:51.105 --> 44:53.899
I'm already pissed with this place,
and now you're getting on my nerves.

44:53.982 --> 44:57.861
Listen. You guys
are way younger than me, all right?

44:57.945 --> 45:00.197
You think I fucking care you're older?

45:00.280 --> 45:03.992
Go on, do it yourself.
Do it! Go on! I scared him.

45:04.076 --> 45:06.078
What, are you scared? You should be!

45:07.371 --> 45:10.833
Hey, Ji-ung, relax!
Don't do it. Just let him go, Ji-ung.

45:12.334 --> 45:13.711
Stop! Get out of there.

45:19.216 --> 45:21.260
Fucker!

45:21.343 --> 45:24.596
Hey, get off each other! Get off now!

45:30.436 --> 45:32.855
What happened here?
Tell me what's going on.

45:32.938 --> 45:34.440
I fell down, sir.

45:36.942 --> 45:39.778
-You're saying Min Ji-ung did nothing?
-Correct, sir!

45:39.862 --> 45:41.989
The inmate was just trying
to help me out of the water.

45:42.573 --> 45:44.199
-What the hell--
-Thank you.

45:45.492 --> 45:47.119
I won't ever forget this.

45:55.294 --> 45:56.670
What is he…

46:03.051 --> 46:03.927
Min Ji-ung.

46:06.096 --> 46:10.058
About what happened earlier, are you sure
you didn't have anything to do with it?

46:12.811 --> 46:16.148
You can mess with the others if you want,
but don't ever mess with that guy.

46:16.231 --> 46:17.399
What if I do?

46:20.152 --> 46:21.653
You'll be sure to regret it.

46:22.863 --> 46:25.073
Kim Su-gyeom. Doesn't ring a bell?

46:26.450 --> 46:28.786
He started out
as a victim of bullying himself.

46:29.578 --> 46:31.830
Then, one day,
he decided that he had enough.

46:32.873 --> 46:34.374
He killed every one of them.

46:36.877 --> 46:38.378
Get the fuck outta here, loser!

46:38.879 --> 46:41.632
What the fuck are you doing?
Get the fuck away from me!

46:42.132 --> 46:43.509
He's gone crazy!

46:44.051 --> 46:45.886
Go! Go! Go!

46:45.969 --> 46:47.179
Move! Move!

47:06.114 --> 47:09.409
Holy shit, I remember this story.
It was all over the news.

47:09.493 --> 47:12.329
He's the bully killer! It's him!

47:12.412 --> 47:15.958
As long as you had you nothing to do with
it, maybe you should stay out of his way.

47:39.940 --> 47:41.024
Hey, watch it!

48:43.587 --> 48:45.505
-Sir, nothing.
-Nothing here.

48:46.131 --> 48:48.300
-Nothing here.
-Nothing here either!

48:48.383 --> 48:51.511
A spoon has gone missing, so
we will be conducting a full body search

48:51.595 --> 48:53.513
on each of you until we find it.

48:53.597 --> 48:54.598
Got that?

48:54.681 --> 48:56.725
A spoon can be modified
and used as a weapon.

48:56.808 --> 48:59.436
We're doing this for your safety. Begin.

49:10.906 --> 49:13.367
-It's that guy!
-Keep your hands on your head!

49:13.951 --> 49:16.703
I saw him taking a spoon earlier
when we were cleaning.

49:16.787 --> 49:18.372
I'm sure he has it on him.

49:20.749 --> 49:22.042
Step aside.

49:22.918 --> 49:24.711
Turn around. Hands on your head.

49:27.923 --> 49:30.342
It's in his left pocket. The left one.

49:42.854 --> 49:44.398
Toothpaste.

49:46.733 --> 49:50.237
Hey, kid. Next time, you should think
before you speak. Am I clear?

49:51.113 --> 49:53.156
Get back to the search. Back in line.

49:53.240 --> 49:56.576
-Eyes to the front!
-Face forward. Hands on head.

49:56.660 --> 49:59.913
-Don't make me repeat myself.
-Face to the wall.

50:00.580 --> 50:03.000
-Don't mess with me.
-Hands on your head!

50:04.668 --> 50:05.836
Nothing here.

50:13.218 --> 50:15.512
Move! Get out of the way!

50:20.183 --> 50:22.102
I'm already serving the maximum sentence,

50:22.185 --> 50:25.105
so killing another person
won't change anything for me.

50:25.188 --> 50:26.565
Get away from him!

50:29.067 --> 50:30.694
Everyone inside!

50:30.777 --> 50:34.322
You can't escape me, kid.
I'll make this your personal hell!

50:34.406 --> 50:37.367
-I can play these games forever.
-Get him off now!

50:38.660 --> 50:40.787
There's a lot of guys like me in here.

50:42.205 --> 50:44.249
We're gonna have fun together.

50:44.332 --> 50:45.959
I'll see you around!

51:05.896 --> 51:07.481
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

51:07.564 --> 51:09.191
The enemy of human rights!

51:09.274 --> 51:13.361
The Bureau must apologize.
Apologize! Apologize!

51:13.445 --> 51:15.113
The enemy of human rights!

51:15.197 --> 51:17.783
The Bureau must apologize! Apologize!

51:17.866 --> 51:21.286
Hey, we want answers!
Don't run away from us! Minister!

51:21.369 --> 51:25.624
Minister! Minister!
Hey, you can't leave like this!

51:25.707 --> 51:27.125
You come back here, now!

51:27.209 --> 51:29.920
-You can't run away!
-Hey! We're not leaving!

51:30.003 --> 51:31.254
We'll stay here all day!

51:31.338 --> 51:35.467
Minister! Minister. Hey, wait up.
Wait! You have to talk to us!

51:35.550 --> 51:38.053
-We want answers!
-Answer our questions, Minister.

51:38.136 --> 51:42.432
Minister, we want answers. Is it true
that you sent our children to a real jail?

51:43.350 --> 51:44.184
That's correct.

51:44.267 --> 51:47.354
How dare you
do something so cruel to my child?

51:47.437 --> 51:49.815
Think of it as a field trip.

51:49.898 --> 51:51.483
That's where they'll end up anyways.

51:51.566 --> 51:54.277
Oh, come on! Are you hearing
what you're saying right now?

51:54.361 --> 51:57.114
You think you can do this to our children
without asking for permission?

51:57.197 --> 51:59.699
Would you have granted permission
if we had asked?

51:59.783 --> 52:01.701
-What?
-At least you should've told us!

52:01.785 --> 52:04.121
I can't believe your arrogance!

52:04.204 --> 52:07.833
-This is bullshit.
-You've got some choice words for us.

52:09.501 --> 52:11.002
Since you enjoy writing so much,

52:11.086 --> 52:14.256
write about what your wonderful children
did to deserve being sent to jail.

52:14.339 --> 52:16.675
-What did you say?
-I can't believe what I'm hearing.

52:16.758 --> 52:18.885
What makes you think
you'll get away with this?

52:18.969 --> 52:22.514
I will use whatever power I have
to have you removed from office,

52:22.597 --> 52:24.474
so you can look forward to that!

52:24.558 --> 52:27.936
You really think that
because you're a minister, it'll save you?

52:28.019 --> 52:29.771
There's no need to threaten him.

52:29.855 --> 52:33.275
We don't need to. We'll just inform
the press and Congress will do the rest!

52:33.358 --> 52:35.527
You're absolutely right.
You scared now? Huh? Asshole!

52:35.610 --> 52:38.697
We'll talk about that tomorrow
when you come visit the school.

52:38.780 --> 52:41.533
School? Why the hell should we listen
to anything you have to say to us?

52:41.616 --> 52:44.828
You'll go because it'll be
your last chance to see your children.

52:44.911 --> 52:45.996
Then again, it's up to you.

52:46.079 --> 52:47.622
-What did you say?
-The last chance to--

52:47.706 --> 52:49.624
-What does he mean?
-Say that one more time!

52:49.708 --> 52:52.002
Minister, you come back here right now!

52:52.502 --> 52:55.630
MINISTRY OF JUSTICE

53:12.063 --> 53:13.231
Go inside.

53:13.315 --> 53:14.816
-Mom!
-Dad! Oh my God!

53:14.900 --> 53:17.194
-Dad!
-Oh, Ji-ung!

53:18.320 --> 53:20.655
You do not answer any of the questions.

53:20.739 --> 53:23.450
-My goodness! My sweetheart.
-Are you all right?

53:23.533 --> 53:26.036
You don't look healthy.
You don't look like you've been eating.

53:26.119 --> 53:28.747
No, it's okay.
I'm right here. Daddy's right here.

53:28.830 --> 53:32.500
What did they do to your hair?
And your clothes? How dare they?

53:32.584 --> 53:36.630
Minister, what's going on here?
Why are our children dressed like this?

53:36.713 --> 53:38.673
I've heard what you did to them.

53:38.757 --> 53:42.177
You took away their phones, and locked
them up, and made them wash dishes.

53:42.260 --> 53:44.387
He doesn't even wash dishes at home!

53:44.888 --> 53:47.807
You kept them in the same prison
as thieves and dangerous criminals!

53:47.891 --> 53:49.226
How dare you do that to my son?

53:49.309 --> 53:52.520
How could you send young 14-year-old boys
to a jail with criminals?

53:52.604 --> 53:56.233
They're just children.
Juvenile offenders have rights!

53:57.108 --> 53:58.109
All right.

54:00.862 --> 54:02.072
Do you know what this is?

54:02.822 --> 54:04.532
What the hell is that?

54:06.243 --> 54:07.410
Tell your parents.

54:10.455 --> 54:13.500
They're just diet pills.
The other kids wanted them.

54:13.583 --> 54:16.378
They asked me to get them.
They threatened me.

54:16.461 --> 54:18.296
It's not my fault!

54:25.262 --> 54:27.472
Stop that!

54:27.555 --> 54:31.309
Let go of my son!
What the hell is the matter with you?

54:31.393 --> 54:33.728
Oh my God, sweetheart. Are you okay?

54:33.812 --> 54:35.814
-Oh my God.
-I swallowed it. Shit!

54:35.897 --> 54:37.649
What's going on?

54:37.732 --> 54:39.442
Momma, I'm gonna die!

54:39.526 --> 54:41.861
What's wrong? What happened?

54:41.945 --> 54:44.572
Aren't they diet pills?
Scared of losing a little weight?

54:44.656 --> 54:46.324
Sweetheart, what's going on?

54:48.785 --> 54:51.913
-Mom, call an ambulance, quick!
-They're just vitamins. Don't worry.

54:51.997 --> 54:53.456
You can relax.

54:55.250 --> 54:56.668
What do you mean they were vitamins?

54:57.335 --> 54:59.212
Fuck. Mom, I'm screwed. He set me up.

54:59.296 --> 55:01.923
Seems like you know
you shouldn't be taking those pills.

55:02.007 --> 55:04.092
I thought I was gonna die.
You have to help me.

55:04.175 --> 55:06.845
They look identical
to the pills they were selling at school.

55:06.928 --> 55:09.597
Phentermine, a drug
available by prescription only.

55:11.599 --> 55:13.852
These are the drugs
they pushed on the other kids.

55:17.272 --> 55:20.692
Mom. I… I really didn't know, Mom.
Honestly, I had no idea, Mom.

55:20.775 --> 55:21.985
Mom!

55:22.068 --> 55:23.445
My son said he didn't know!

55:24.279 --> 55:26.364
They're children who made
a few mistakes, all right?

55:26.448 --> 55:29.159
They're kids. They're young.
They don't know better.

55:29.242 --> 55:32.704
They don't understand the consequences of
what they're doing. They're just minors.

55:32.787 --> 55:36.416
They have to be protected and cared for
by adults. We know that, right?

55:36.499 --> 55:38.626
We can't expect kids not to make mistakes.

55:38.710 --> 55:40.879
They just need another chance!

55:40.962 --> 55:44.341
Please, look at the screen.
This is the evidence we collected,

55:44.424 --> 55:47.385
which shows the extent
of their drug business and network.

55:48.970 --> 55:52.057
They have made over 50 million won
by selling drugs.

55:52.140 --> 55:53.266
Incredible, isn't it?

55:55.477 --> 55:58.855
Juvenile offenders?
Minors that need our protection?

55:59.939 --> 56:03.485
Don't make me laugh.
What about their victims at school? Hm?

56:05.570 --> 56:06.696
Who will protect them?

56:08.656 --> 56:09.991
They didn't know!

56:10.075 --> 56:11.201
It's okay, honey.

56:11.284 --> 56:14.996
It's not too late to educate them now,
is it? They'll learn.

56:15.080 --> 56:17.457
How about we all pitch in
for a settlement?

56:17.540 --> 56:20.794
And with the money,
we'll compensate all the victims.

56:20.877 --> 56:23.880
We just need to submit all of this
in writing. Isn't that correct?

56:23.963 --> 56:27.092
We'll submit everything.
And we'll pay for whatever else is needed.

56:27.175 --> 56:29.636
-Please, go easy on them, sir.
-Just this once.

56:29.719 --> 56:31.388
They're still young children.

56:31.471 --> 56:35.058
We wouldn't want to destroy their future
and have a few mistakes ruin their lives?

56:35.141 --> 56:36.726
Shut up!

56:39.729 --> 56:42.023
"Do unto others
what you would have them do unto you."

56:43.149 --> 56:45.610
That is the fundamental law of society.

56:47.529 --> 56:50.573
And that is what you
should have taught your children.

56:52.450 --> 56:54.536
If you could not,
then the school should have.

56:56.162 --> 56:59.791
And if the school couldn't do it,
then we as a society should've done it.

57:00.417 --> 57:04.170
The Bureau has stepped in because
no one was able to teach them this lesson.

57:04.254 --> 57:06.297
I assure you we will not fail.

57:07.507 --> 57:10.301
We will teach them
that actions have consequences,

57:10.385 --> 57:13.680
and they will never be allowed
to forget the agony they've caused.

57:19.727 --> 57:21.855
This is how they will learn their lesson.

57:33.450 --> 57:34.993
Mom, do something about this.

57:35.785 --> 57:37.036
-Please?
-I will, sweetheart.

57:38.037 --> 57:40.790
Oh, Ji-ung just told me
how much he regrets his actions.

57:40.874 --> 57:44.961
Find it in your heart to forgive them.
You boys will never do this again, right?

57:45.044 --> 57:46.004
No!

57:46.087 --> 57:48.214
I was wrong!
I did something I shouldn't have.

57:48.298 --> 57:50.383
I'm so sorry. I regret everything I did.

57:52.469 --> 57:56.097
I won't ever do it again.
I just want to be given one more chance!

57:59.058 --> 58:01.269
This is how it should have been
the first time.

58:01.352 --> 58:04.522
Please, I can't go back there.
Please don't make me go back!

58:04.606 --> 58:06.858
Don't ask us for forgiveness.

58:08.234 --> 58:09.277
Ask your victim.

58:53.029 --> 58:54.364
I will never…

58:56.783 --> 58:58.826
ever forgive you for what you've done.

59:02.539 --> 59:05.708
Ever since I met you guys,
my life has been torture.

59:07.335 --> 59:11.172
Every day, I was terrified. I was
so scared that I could hardly breathe.

59:12.590 --> 59:14.092
To me, school

59:15.760 --> 59:17.178
was a living hell.

59:20.431 --> 59:23.893
You can't escape me, kid.
I'll make this your personal hell!

59:23.977 --> 59:26.271
I can play these games forever.

59:27.939 --> 59:30.567
Why should I be the one to pay
when you are the guilty ones?

59:31.651 --> 59:33.278
I don't wanna hurt anymore.

59:33.778 --> 59:35.780
I want my life to keep going!

59:35.863 --> 59:37.740
You still don't get it, do you?

59:38.783 --> 59:40.535
I'm a juvenile offender,

59:40.618 --> 59:43.580
which means I can get away
with killing you, you bitch!

59:43.663 --> 59:45.790
Ji-ung, stop! Oh God!

59:52.880 --> 59:56.467
The parents' request
for the release of their children

59:57.802 --> 59:59.512
is now hereby officially denied.

01:00:00.805 --> 01:00:03.141
-Officially denied?
-Don't do this, Minister!

01:00:03.224 --> 01:00:04.142
You can't!

01:00:04.225 --> 01:00:07.061
The boys will be taken back
to the detention center.

01:00:07.145 --> 01:00:08.730
Oh no! You can't do this!

01:00:08.813 --> 01:00:12.191
You can't do this to my son!
Ji-ung, no! No!

01:00:13.860 --> 01:00:15.945
That's my son! Don't touch him! Don't!

01:00:16.029 --> 01:00:17.071
-Please!
-Wait!

01:00:17.155 --> 01:00:18.906
Min-su! Min-su!

01:00:23.911 --> 01:00:25.413
Hey! Please, don't!

01:00:25.496 --> 01:00:28.291
No, please don't take him from me!

01:00:28.374 --> 01:00:31.836
Min-su! Min-su!

01:01:14.253 --> 01:01:15.546
Thank you so much.

01:01:17.298 --> 01:01:20.176
From now on, schools in Korea
will no longer accept students

01:01:20.259 --> 01:01:21.844
with criminal records in the classroom.

01:01:22.679 --> 01:01:24.972
For decades,
we have asked for legislative reform,

01:01:25.056 --> 01:01:26.516
but nothing has been done.

01:01:26.599 --> 01:01:29.185
In the meantime,
the number of crimes committed by minors

01:01:29.268 --> 01:01:30.395
has continued to increase.

01:01:30.478 --> 01:01:33.940
Because of this, innocent students
continue to suffer in school.

01:01:34.023 --> 01:01:37.819
The Bureau will not stand for this. We
will protect them against the offenders.

01:01:38.778 --> 01:01:41.030
Maybe you believe them to be innocent,

01:01:41.114 --> 01:01:42.156
but to us,

01:01:42.740 --> 01:01:44.325
they need to be taught a lesson.

01:01:48.037 --> 01:01:50.331
Hey, the boys are back!

01:01:55.670 --> 01:01:57.130
Did you miss me already?

01:02:07.890 --> 01:02:09.142
I can't believe it.

01:02:13.479 --> 01:02:16.190
Get inside.

01:02:16.274 --> 01:02:18.317
It's time for you to pay the price, guys.

01:02:29.328 --> 01:02:30.204
Oh!

01:02:32.790 --> 01:02:33.708
I'm sorry.

01:02:57.023 --> 01:02:58.232
Get inside.

01:03:01.319 --> 01:03:03.613
Feel the fear that you made them feel.

01:03:04.113 --> 01:03:06.073
You'll learn a lot of things in here.

01:03:14.957 --> 01:03:15.958
Come on.

01:03:16.709 --> 01:03:17.585
All of you

01:03:21.547 --> 01:03:23.758
How long will we have to stay here, sir?

01:03:24.550 --> 01:03:25.802
Until you turn 18.

01:03:26.844 --> 01:03:30.598
Then you'll be held accountable.
You'll pay for the things you've done.

01:03:39.190 --> 01:03:43.069
Yun-jin! Yun-jin. I'm sorry.
Please, Yun-jin! Yun-jin, I was wrong.

01:03:43.152 --> 01:03:46.113
I won't ever do it again.
Please just open the door. Please?

01:03:46.197 --> 01:03:47.698
Yun-jin!

01:03:47.782 --> 01:03:48.908
Yun-jin!

01:03:59.460 --> 01:04:01.379
-Well done, everyone.
-Thank you.

01:04:01.462 --> 01:04:03.172
-Appreciate it.
-Thanks.

01:04:09.846 --> 01:04:11.722
Are you sure this is all you want?

01:04:12.431 --> 01:04:13.599
Yes, sir.

01:04:14.684 --> 01:04:16.435
This was the only thing I could think of.

01:04:17.436 --> 01:04:18.437
All right, then.

01:04:20.231 --> 01:04:21.524
Thank you for all your help.

01:04:21.607 --> 01:04:24.819
Not at all.
I was the one who offered to help you.

01:04:26.737 --> 01:04:28.239
But, please,

01:04:28.739 --> 01:04:30.408
could you promise me just one thing?

01:04:32.952 --> 01:04:35.496
Can you make sure
that no one turns out like me?

01:04:37.498 --> 01:04:39.917
I think that the Bureau
could achieve that dream.

01:04:40.585 --> 01:04:41.878
Pass me the ball!

01:04:43.546 --> 01:04:44.839
Nice one, man.

01:04:46.257 --> 01:04:48.092
So, can I really have this?

01:04:49.594 --> 01:04:54.974
Just like the day we met

01:04:55.516 --> 01:04:58.811
How can I let you go?

01:05:01.647 --> 01:05:03.149
Hey, you newbie.

01:05:06.068 --> 01:05:07.028
Yes, sir.

01:05:07.820 --> 01:05:09.947
You've heard of the boss from the BS gang?

01:05:11.365 --> 01:05:15.036
-Sure, but I swear, I didn't tell anyone.
-Ah, shh, you're good.

01:05:15.119 --> 01:05:17.371
It's all right. Good work.

01:05:17.455 --> 01:05:19.624
But you know our boss
can get a little paranoid, right?

01:05:19.707 --> 01:05:20.917
Yes, sir.

01:05:22.126 --> 01:05:23.210
Night, night.

01:05:31.218 --> 01:05:32.386
Hey, hey, hey!
